I'll let you use our jolly Roger.

262
00:20:35,540 --> 00:20:36,370
That's what you want.

263
00:20:36,453 --> 00:20:37,283
Oh fee

264
00:20:37,620 --> 00:20:39,980
Catch is if you're ever defeated.

265
00:20:40,180 --> 00:20:41,377
You'll have to give it up.

266
00:20:41,460 --> 00:20:42,540
You got it.

267
00:20:42,900 --> 00:20:43,780
Oh, right

268
00:20:48,440 --> 00:20:51,400
I don't need weaklings as my subordinates.

269
00:20:51,860 --> 00:20:54,980
Don't worry, I won't lose to anyone!

270
00:20:57,440 --> 00:20:58,640
Hey! Bellamy!

271
00:20:58,960 --> 00:21:00,431
Are you hanging in there?

272
00:21:01,080 --> 00:21:02,962
I mean, I know you're not great!

273
00:21:03,360 --> 00:21:07,220
Thing is, the time when pirates
dreamt about the future is over!

274
00:21:07,600 --> 00:21:11,776
I've eaten a cursed fruit too, and
you don't stand a chance against me!

275
00:21:14,920 --> 00:21:15,750
Spring!

276
00:21:18,120 --> 00:21:18,950
Haki!

277
00:21:38,620 --> 00:21:43,560
For starters, I saw the
Sky Island just like you.

278
00:21:44,080 --> 00:21:46,517
I lost all my crewmates on that trip,

279
00:21:46,600 --> 00:21:49,365
But it turned my view of
the world upside down.

280
00:21:49,820 --> 00:21:52,820
I'm not going to hold a
grudge against you anymore.

281
00:21:52,940 --> 00:21:56,380
Either way, I'm done laughing at you.

282
00:21:57,880 --> 00:21:58,860
You okay?

283
00:21:59,280 --> 00:22:01,300
You have changed, Bellamy.

284
00:22:02,380 --> 00:22:04,160
Hey, don't push yourself.

285
00:22:04,520 --> 00:22:05,800
Just rest for a sec.

286
00:22:09,320 --> 00:22:12,480
So Joker is ordering me
to murder Straw Hat now?

287
00:22:12,980 --> 00:22:14,697
Dolphy's a generous leader.

288
00:22:14,780 --> 00:22:16,920
Even though you lost the tournament,

289
00:22:17,280 --> 00:22:20,017
he's giving you one more
chance to redeem yourself.

290
00:22:20,100 --> 00:22:22,920
You should be happy your task is so easy.

291
00:22:23,960 --> 00:22:24,790
Well,

292
00:22:24,873 --> 00:22:26,877
if you're standing there
and not murdering Straw Hat,

293
00:22:26,960 --> 00:22:28,657
then I say you're not busy enough.

294
00:22:28,740 --> 00:22:30,564
You need me to give you a hand?

295
00:22:32,140 --> 00:22:33,960
Huh, weird. An earthquake.

296
00:22:37,780 --> 00:22:41,277
You really want me to spell
it out for you? All right?

297
00:22:41,360 --> 00:22:44,680
Your purpose has never
been the same as mine.

298
00:22:50,880 --> 00:22:52,420
I can't do it!

299
00:22:53,120 --> 00:22:54,320
You're my friend!

300
00:22:57,780 --> 00:22:59,020
Hey, Bellamy.

301
00:22:59,500 --> 00:23:00,500
I'm sorry.

302
00:23:00,700 --> 00:23:02,257
I gotta leave you here for now.

303
00:23:02,340 --> 00:23:04,105
I'm real worried about Traffy.

304
00:23:04,420 --> 00:23:06,832
The real Mingo and Snot Guy are up there.

305
00:23:07,020 --> 00:23:08,200
They're too strong.

306
00:23:08,560 --> 00:23:09,957
He needs my help.

307
00:23:10,040 --> 00:23:13,360
I'll give Mingo an extra kick
in the ass for you, okay?

308
00:23:13,800 --> 00:23:14,920
Hold on.

309
00:23:16,140 --> 00:23:18,160
You remember this technique?

310
00:23:18,960 --> 00:23:20,500
It's been a while.

311
00:23:21,660 --> 00:23:23,100
Okay, you ready?

312
00:23:23,720 --> 00:23:25,060
Spring Hopper!

313
00:23:26,460 --> 00:23:27,640
Let's go!

314
00:23:29,680 --> 00:23:33,740
You got stronger since last
time, but I got stronger too!

315
00:23:35,320 --> 00:23:37,480
You want to see destructive power?

316
00:23:37,740 --> 00:23:39,328
I'm taking this to the max!

317
00:23:40,260 --> 00:23:41,580
You're finally free!

318
00:23:41,880 --> 00:23:43,680
Now cut it out before you die!

319
00:23:47,600 --> 00:23:48,430
Pathetic!

320
00:23:48,513 --> 00:23:50,241
Stop showing mercy to your enemy!

321
00:23:51,860 --> 00:23:53,380
I know I'm pitiful!

322
00:23:53,620 --> 00:23:55,738
I know I looked up to the wrong man!

323
00:23:55,880 --> 00:23:57,821
I don't need to hear it from you!

324
00:24:06,600 --> 00:24:07,430
Nah.

325
00:24:07,513 --> 00:24:09,260
That's for the victor to decide.

326
00:24:11,620 --> 00:24:15,557
This pitiful worm,
crawled here just to die.

327
00:24:15,640 --> 00:24:17,220
Isn't that right, Bellamy?

328
00:24:19,320 --> 00:24:20,820
But I made my choice.

329
00:24:21,040 --> 00:24:23,717
I can't turn on him just because
I didn't get what I wanted.

330
00:24:23,800 --> 00:24:27,097
If I don't see this through to the
end, then I'll be worse than a failure.

331
00:24:27,180 --> 00:24:28,960
I'll be a complete disgrace.

332
00:24:31,600 --> 00:24:33,477
I have to hold on to something.

333
00:24:33,560 --> 00:24:36,320
Even a loser like me has some dignity.

334
00:24:36,900 --> 00:24:37,730
See?

335
00:24:37,813 --> 00:24:39,680
This will be my final battle, Straw Hat!

336
00:24:40,200 --> 00:24:42,200
See it through to the end with me!
